// The residual of the derived cash flow against the published cash flow by financial year and section: operating,
// investing and financing activities, and the reserve movements that have no cash counterpart. Expected values are the
// section rows of audit.tac_cash_flow_section_residual, which the build writes and the SQL tests check.
EVALUATE
SUMMARIZECOLUMNS (
    'Fiscal Year'[Financial Year],
    'TAC Cash Flow Line'[Cash Flow Section],
    "derived", [TAC Cash Flow (derived)],
    "published", [TAC Cash Flow (published)],
    "residual", [TAC Cash Flow Residual]
)
ORDER BY 'Fiscal Year'[Financial Year], 'TAC Cash Flow Line'[Cash Flow Section]
